l a wolf decides they want to eat you... Explore each level, relax to the music and soak in the visual style while you level up and prepare to face the Brown Bear!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755380/extras/42926d59669ef7a3178e3d941dc8c6a1.poster.avif?t=1750470169\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755380/extras/42926d59669ef7a3178e3d941dc8c6a1.webm?t=1750470169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755380/extras/42926d59669ef7a3178e3d941dc8c6a1.mp4?t=1750470169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on real life, but not too much</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All critters, environments and abilities in the game are based on the real life ecosystem of an owl. Do owls throw feathers at their enemies? Probably not, but at least they aren't shooting out laser beams. Wait, the bear does that... crap. <i>Mostly-based-on-real-life-ecosystem*</i></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755380/extras/be5a2500a198c26d13748dfee133a640.poster.avif?t=1750470169\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755380/extras/be5a2500a198c26d13748dfee133a640.webm?t=1750470169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755380/extras/be5a2500a198c26d13748dfee133a640.mp4?t=1750470169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>----PARLIAMENT IS A WORK IN PROGRESS----</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our project is roughly <strong>25% complete</strong>. If you want to check out our progress so far, check out the demo!</p>",
